                    sharpen session --agent cursor   use cursor-agent instead of claude
  2. Working pane:  sharpen join               join that pair (restart the agent there afterwards)
  3. Send a draft:  type it in the sharpen pane, or press  prefix+v  anywhere in the pair to dictate
  4. Adjust:        type "shorter, drop step 3"   or press  prefix+V  and speak it
  5. Paste:         when you see "copied — READY", Cmd-V in the working pane

KEYS (tmux, after `tmux source-file .../sharpen.tmux`)
  prefix+v   dictate a new draft          prefix+V   dictate a refinement of the current draft
  prefix+y   put this pair's last sharpened message back on the clipboard
  Ctrl-C ends the recording; wait a few seconds. Dictation is pasted into the sharpen session AND
  submitted automatically (queued if it is mid-pass). Nothing for you to paste or send.

