  clipboard replaced  another pair replied first: the notice names it; prefix+y brings yours back
  no context shown    header says "none": join a working pane, or sharpen pair <selector>
  voice not arriving  popup stays open with the reason and your text is saved. Clear the sharpen
                      pane's input box, then:  sharpen resend   (sharpen status shows the last try)
  unclear target      the popup lists the sharpen sessions: type a number, c = copy, Enter = skip
  log                 ~/.config/sharpen/.hook.log

More: sharpen help commands   (every command)   |   sharpen <command> --help   (one command)
